<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thursday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				buying rate	 selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   42.48		 42.55</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	67.75		 67.85</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 27.85		 27.90</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.376		 0.378</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.31		 11.33</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.56		 11.58</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.14		  1.16</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 6.10 pct	    6.30 pct</p>
</text>
